From: Thiagarajan Rajagopalan <thiaraja@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Feb 2026 13:00:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] pwhm: Add DataModels for DynamicVlan and BeaconRates This
 commit addressess the below FRs, 1. [MPSK/Dynamic VLAN for UD] 2.
  [UD--GAP: MLME MGMT Beacon Control]

Added relevant data models for the the above FRs in this commit.

Change-Id: I7d5c235b6d82cc0850a20098bfa0e26c4f74f22a
Signed-off-by: Thiagarajan Rajagopalan <thiaraja@qti.qualcomm.com>
